pe":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"WorldActivityOptions"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TAdapter"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TStream"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"WorldActivityResult"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TStream"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Mint a session token on the server"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { generateWorld } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { reactorWorld } from '@tanstack/ai-reactor'\n\nconst world = await generateWorld({\n  adapter: reactorWorld('visko-orbis-stable'),\n  prompt: 'A neon cyberpunk city at night, slow aerial drift',\n})\n\n// Hand world.token, world.model, and world.prompt to the browser.","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"World generation is an experimental feature and may change."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tadapter","text":"TAdapter","level":3},{"id":"tstream","text":"TStream","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction generateWorld<TAdapter, TStream>(options): WorldActivityResult<TStream>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/generateWorld/index.ts:156](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/generateWorld/index.ts#L156)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nWorld generation activity. Live adapters mint a session token. Job\nadapters return a viewer URL or an in-progress operation id.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TAdapter\n\n`TAdapter` *extends* [`WorldAdapter`](../interfaces/WorldAdapter.md)\\<`string`, `WorldProviderOptions`\\<`TAdapter`\\>\\>\n\n### TStream\n\n`TStream` *extends* `boolean` = `false`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`WorldActivityOptions`\\<`TAdapter`, `TStream`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`WorldActivityResult`\\<`TStream`\\>\n\n## Example\n\n**Mint a session token on the server**\n\n```ts\nimport { generateWorld } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { reactorWorld } from '@tanstack/ai-reactor'\n\nconst world = await generateWorld({\n  adapter: reactorWorld('visko-orbis-stable'),\n  prompt: 'A neon cyberpunk city at night, slow aerial drift',\n})\n\n// Hand world.token, world.model, and world.prompt to the browser.\n```\n\n World generation is an experimental feature and may change.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: generateWorld\ntitle: generateWorld\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction generateWorld<TAdapter, TStream>(options): WorldActivityResult<TStream>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/generateWorld/index.ts:156](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/generateWorld/index.ts#L156)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nWorld generation activity. Live adapters mint a session token. Job\nadapters return a viewer URL or an in-progress operation id.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TAdapter\n\n`TAdapter` *extends* [`WorldAdapter`](../interfaces/WorldAdapter.md)\\<`string`, `WorldProviderOptions`\\<`TAdapter`\\>\\>\n\n### TStream\n\n`TStream` *extends* `boolean` = `false`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`WorldActivityOptions`\\<`TAdapter`, `TStream`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`WorldActivityResult`\\<`TStream`\\>\n\n## Example\n\n**Mint a session token on the server**\n\n```ts\nimport { generateWorld } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { reactorWorld } from '@tanstack/ai-reactor'\n\nconst world = await generateWorld({\n  adapter: reactorWorld('visko-orbis-stable'),\n  prompt: 'A neon cyberpunk city at night, slow aerial drift',\n})\n\n// Hand world.token, world.model, and world.prompt to the browser.\n```\n\n World generation is an experimental feature and may change.\n"}
